# <type>(<scope>): <short summary>
#
# Examples:
# feat(counting): Implement Counting Forest PLAY stage
# fix(audio): Prevent duplicate speech
# docs(git): Document recovery workflow
#
# Types:
# feat, fix, refactor, style, docs, test, chore, hotfix
